Extracted from gateway, telemetry and Home Assistant work developed alongside
https://github.com/tomjtobin/vacuula-ios and maintained as a standalone project.

This project is independent of Neato Robotics, Vorwerk, Vacuula and Home Assistant.
No proprietary Neato firmware or Python modules are distributed. Stock services
and installed firmware are used through observed protocol interfaces.

Robot dependencies are downloaded separately with exact hashes. Their upstream
license files are retained by the installer under /user/neato-gateway/licenses:
zeroconf 0.38.7 (LGPL-2.1-or-later), ifaddr 0.2.0 (MIT), pathlib2 2.3.7.post1 (MIT),
and six 1.16.0 (MIT). See the wheel-provided notices for exact terms and authors.
